+//! Four-rank GLM byte gather using TensorFold PR30's complete RDMA protocol.
+//! First xor1 gathers pairs, then xor3 gathers pair bundles into [0,1,2,3].
+//! The model's FP32 rank-order reduction is untouched. Attribution/pin: glm-neighbor-source.json.
+const std = @import("std");
